   "parts": [
    [
     5.1,
     10.92
    ]
   ],
   "text": "It is also common for them, blank, during traditional Chinese holidays, such as the Spring Festival."
  },
  {
   "k": 3,
   "id": "s03",
   "start": 11.65,
   "end": 18.51,
   "parts": [
